summary: 'Session restart checkpoint. The "decisions + visual proposed-changes" MVP is built + bundled on branch conductor-revival-phase0 (latest commit 1a3b17c1). On top of THE BRIDGE (full-screen fleet cockpit), Conductor now: injects a per-session concision system prompt (--append-system-prompt), parses host-rendered fenced blocks, renders agent DECISIONS as inline cards (select/type/chat; amber→teal on commit; drives the first-class needs-you amber), and renders VISUALS in THE LIGHTBOX (a canvas drawer over the CHORUS rail: mermaid flows offline + comparison tables). Cockpit fonts are now larger + ⌘=/⌘- adjustable. Matt is restarting to keep working on this feature wave.'
